 {
  "key": "iris-demo",
  "title": "Kedro iris on SageMaker — champion / challenger",
  "subtitle": "Every compute step runs `kedro run --env sagemaker`. Training registers a challenger; only the promoter role can move the champion tag. Snowflake and the schedule are target design (deployed today: S3, on-demand runs).",
  "desc": "A data scientist starts the train pipeline (Preprocess, Train, Evaluate). A model that passes the quality gate is registered pending approval and tagged challenger. An authorized promoter assumes the promoter IAM role to approve it and move the champion tag. On a schedule, the inference pipeline resolves the champion tag at run time, scores a batch and writes predictions back to Snowflake.",
